{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52448","headline":"回波乐 九十一 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 九十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"父母时怨家，生一五逆子。\n养大长成人，元来不得使。\n身役不肯料，逃走皆（张改作「离」，项、蒋校「背」）家里。\n阿耶替役身，阿娘气病死。\n腹中怀恶来，自生煞人子。\n此是前生恶，故故来相值。\n虫蛇来报恩，人子合如此。\n前怨续後怨，何时逍祖唯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52448.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52448","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}